| Session type | Storage path |
|---|---|
| Regular (SDK) | `{workDir}/.consilium/sessions/regular/{sessionId}/` (wire.jsonl, context.jsonl, state.json) |
| Think | `{workDir}/.consilium/sessions/think/{sessionId}.jsonl` + `{sessionId}.json` (metadata) |
